  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nWhen you die, you appear in a cinema with a number of other people who look like you. You find out that they are your previous reincarnations, and soon you all begin watching your next life on the big screen. It's an interesting phenomenon for sure, because you can see your past lives, and you can see the mistakes you made in your previous lives. But the focus of the current film you are watching is your next life, which is about to begin. \n\nThe film you are watching is about a man who is a successful businessman. He's in the banking business and he trades stocks for a living.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 26,
